exports[`/empresa/publicidad/[id] > activa con informe 1`] = `"<div class="df-rise space-y-6"><div><a class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center text-sm text-text-dim underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-text" href="/empresa/publicidad"><span aria-hidden="true">←&nbsp;</span>Publicidad</a><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><h1 class="min-w-0 text-2xl break-words text-text">Pan de masa madre</h1><span class="rounded-xs border border-line px-2 py-0.5 text-2xs text-text-dim">Activa</span></div><p class="mt-1 max-w-prose text-sm text-text-dim">Se está mostrando en su zona, en el feed y en la portada.</p></div><section aria-labelledby="pieza" class="space-y-2"><h2 id="pieza" class="text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Así se verá</h2><aside aria-label="Publicidad" data-pieza="campana" data-tarjeta-anuncio="previa" class="@container mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl"><div class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface "><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 p-5 @2xl:p-8"><div class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-between gap-3"><span data-etiqueta-anuncio="true" class="rounded-xs border border-line px-2 py-0.5 text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text uppercase">Publicidad</span></div><p class="font-display font-semibold text-pretty break-words text-text text-xl @2xl:text-3xl">El mejor pan del barrio</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-2 pt-2"><p class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-dim" data-dominio-anuncio="true">bar.test</p><span class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] shrink-0 items-center rounded-sm border border-line bg-raised px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-text hover:border-text-dim" aria-disabled="true">Visitar<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1.5">↗</span></span></div></div></div></aside><p class="max-w-prose text-2xs break-words text-text-dim">Lleva a <span class="text-text">https://bar.test</span></p></section><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start lg:gap-8"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5"><h2 class="text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">La campaña</h2><dl class="mt-3 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2"><div><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Alcance</dt><dd class="text-text">Una ciudad y alrededores</dd></div><div><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Zona</dt><dd class="break-words text-text">Sevilla y 100 km alrededor</dd></div><div><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Días</dt><dd class="text-text tabular-nums">18 nov – 24 nov 2026</dd></div><div><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Créditos por día</dt><dd class="text-text tabular-nums">2</dd></div></dl><p class="mt-3 text-2xs text-text-dim">Cada día de campaña empieza a la 1:00, hora de Madrid.</p></div></div><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5"><h2 class="text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Qué quieres hacer</h2><div class="mt-3"><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-transparent text-text border-line hover:bg-raised w-full sm:w-auto">Pausar</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-transparent text-text border-transparent hover:bg-raised w-full sm:w-auto">Terminar ya</button></div></div></div></div></div></div><section aria-labelledby="resultados" class="space-y-3"><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5 lg:p-6"><h2 id="resultados" class="text-base font-semibold text-text">Resultados</h2><p class="mt-1 max-w-prose text-sm text-text-dim">Veces que se mostró: las veces que la pusimos en el feed o en la portada. Clics: las veces que alguien la tocó para ir a tu web. Se actualizan cada 10 minutos.</p><dl class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3"><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-3"><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Veces que se mostró</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-text tabular-nums">1234</dd></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-3"><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Clics</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-text tabular-nums">25</dd></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-3"><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Clics por cada 100 veces que se mostró</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-text tabular-nums">2,0</dd></div></dl><table class="mt-5 hidden w-full border-collapse text-left text-sm md:table"><thead class="border-b border-line"><tr><th class="py-2 pr-4 text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Día</th><th class="py-2 pr-4 text-right text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Veces que se mostró</th><th class="py-2 pr-4 text-right text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Clics</th><th class="py-2 text-right text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Clics por cada 100 veces</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-line"><tr data-dia-metricas="2026-11-20"><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 whitespace-nowrap text-text-dim tabular-nums">20 nov 2026</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-right text-text tabular-nums">1</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-right text-text tabular-nums">1</td><td class="py-2.5 text-right text-text-dim tabular-nums">100,0</td></tr><tr data-dia-metricas="2026-11-19"><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 whitespace-nowrap text-text-dim tabular-nums">19 nov 2026</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-right text-text tabular-nums">300</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-right text-text tabular-nums">0</td><td class="py-2.5 text-right text-text-dim tabular-nums">0,0</td></tr><tr data-dia-metricas="2026-11-18"><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 whitespace-nowrap text-text-dim tabular-nums">18 nov 2026</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-right text-text tabular-nums">0</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-right text-text tabular-nums">0</td><td class="py-2.5 text-right text-text-dim tabular-nums">—</td></tr></tbody></table><ul class="mt-4 divide-y divide-line md:hidden"><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-3"><span class="text-sm text-text-dim tabular-nums">20 nov 2026</span><span class="text-right text-sm text-text tabular-nums">se mostró 1 vez · 1 clic</span></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-3"><span class="text-sm text-text-dim tabular-nums">19 nov 2026</span><span class="text-right text-sm text-text tabular-nums">se mostró 300 veces · 0 clics</span></li><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-3"><span class="text-sm text-text-dim tabular-nums">18 nov 2026</span><span class="text-right text-sm text-text tabular-nums">se mostró 0 veces · 0 clics</span></li></ul></div><nav aria-label="Paginación" class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><span></span><a rel="next" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-1.5 rounded-sm border border-line px-4 text-sm font-medium text-text transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised lg:min-h-[38px]" href="/empresa/publicidad/campana0000001?cursor=2026-11-18">Siguiente <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav></section></div>"`;

exports[`/empresa/publicidad/[id] > borrador con estimación de zona 1`] = `"<div class="df-rise space-y-6"><div><a class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center text-sm text-text-dim underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-text" href="/empresa/publicidad"><span aria-hidden="true">←&nbsp;</span>Publicidad</a><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><h1 class="min-w-0 text-2xl break-words text-text">Pan de masa madre</h1><span class="rounded-xs border border-line px-2 py-0.5 text-2xs text-text-dim">Borrador</span></div><p class="mt-1 max-w-prose text-sm text-text-dim">Todavía no ocupa ningún día. Actívala o prográmala cuando quieras.</p></div><section aria-labelledby="pieza" class="space-y-2"><h2 id="pieza" class="text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Así se verá</h2><aside aria-label="Publicidad" data-pieza="campana" data-tarjeta-anuncio="previa" class="@container mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl"><div class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface "><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 p-5 @2xl:p-8"><div class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-between gap-3"><span data-etiqueta-anuncio="true" class="rounded-xs border border-line px-2 py-0.5 text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text uppercase">Publicidad</span></div><p class="font-display font-semibold text-pretty break-words text-text text-xl @2xl:text-3xl">El mejor pan del barrio</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-2 pt-2"><p class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-text-dim" data-dominio-anuncio="true">bar.test</p><span class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] shrink-0 items-center rounded-sm border border-line bg-raised px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-text hover:border-text-dim" aria-disabled="true">Visitar<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1.5">↗</span></span></div></div></div></aside><p class="max-w-prose text-2xs break-words text-text-dim">Lleva a <span class="text-text">https://bar.test</span></p></section><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start lg:gap-8"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5"><h2 class="text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Cuánta gente la verá</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text"><span class="text-2xl font-semibold tabular-nums">unas 1234 </span>personas al día la verían, contando con las demás campañas de esas fechas.</p><p class="mt-2 text-2xs text-text-dim">Calculado con la gente que ha pasado por el feed en tu zona los últimos días, el peor día de tus fechas y redondeado a la baja.</p></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5"><h2 class="text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">La campaña</h2><dl class="mt-3 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2"><div><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Alcance</dt><dd class="text-text">Una ciudad y alrededores</dd></div><div><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Zona</dt><dd class="break-words text-text">Sevilla y 100 km alrededor</dd></div><div><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Empezaría el</dt><dd class="text-text tabular-nums">22 nov 2026 · 7 días</dd></div><div><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Créditos por día</dt><dd class="text-text tabular-nums">1</dd></div><div class="sm:col-span-2"><dt class="text-2xs text-text-dim">Coste total</dt><dd class="text-text tabular-nums"><span class="font-semibold">7 créditos</span></dd><dd class="mt-1 text-2xs text-text-dim">Tienes 40 créditos de publicidad; 5 ya están comprometidos en tus otras campañas, así que te quedan 35 para nuevas.</dd></div></dl><p class="mt-3 text-2xs text-text-dim">Cada día de campaña empieza a la 1:00, hora de Madrid.</p></div></div><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 p-5"><h2 class="text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Qué quieres hacer</h2><div class="mt-3"><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-action text-void border-transparent hover:brightness-110 w-full sm:w-auto">Programar</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-transparent text-text border-transparent hover:bg-raised w-full sm:w-auto">Borrar borrador</button></div></div></div><p class="mt-3 text-2xs text-text-dim">Comprobamos que tienes créditos de publicidad para todos los días, pero no los apartamos: se descuentan cada día de campaña. Si cuando llegue un día no te quedan, la campaña se pausa.</p></div></div></div></div>"`;

